{"d":15,"passage":{"title":"爱玛","author":"Jane Austen","text":"They will have their barouche-landau, of course, which holds four perfectly; and therefore, without saying any thing of _our_ carriage, we should be able to explore the different beauties extremely well. Indeed, when the time draws on, I shall decidedly recommend their bringing the barouche-landau; it will be so very much preferable. When people come into a beautiful country of this sort, you know, Miss Woodhouse, one naturally wishes them to see as much as possible; and Mr. Suckling is extremely fond of exploring. We explored to King's-Weston twice last summer, in that way, most delightfully, just after their first having the barouche-landau. We are rather out of distance of the very striking beauties which attract the sort of parties you speak of; and we are a very quiet set of people, I believe; more disposed to stay at home than engage in schemes of pleasure.\" Many a time has Selina said, when she has been going to Bristol, 'I really cannot get this girl to move from the house. I absolutely must go in by myself, though I hate being stuck up in the barouche-landau without a companion; but Augusta, I believe, with her own good-will, would never stir beyond the park paling.'"},"words":[{"w":"pantyhose","uk":"'pæntihəuz","us":"/'pæntihəuz/","p":"","m":"n. 连裤袜","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"plc","uk":"","us":"","p":"","m":"[计] 可编程逻辑控制器","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"nepal","uk":"ni'pɒːl","us":"/ni'pɑl/","p":"","m":"n. 尼泊尔","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"zimbabwe","uk":"zim'bɑːbwei","us":"/zim'bɑbwei/","p":"","m":"n. 津巴布韦","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"msg","uk":"","us":"","p":"","m":"[医] 谷氨酸一钠","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"barcelona","uk":".bɑːsi'ləunə","us":"/.bɑsi'ləunə/","p":"","m":"n. 巴塞罗那","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"presidential","